{"sha": "bcb49f7489dea6d106b73f72994f7aff641a1acd4b7561c3e797b524ec10e118", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[化学计量数]\\label{def:g8:balanced-equations:coefficient}", "方程式中写在化学式前面的数字，称为该化学式的", "\\emph{化学计量数}\\index{化学计量数}：它", "表示参与反应的该物质的分子（或其他粒子）数目。", "化学计量数为 1 时不写出。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{notation}[状态符号]\\label{not:g8:balanced-equations:states}", "化学式后括号中的字母可以表示其物理状态：", "(s) 固体，(l) 液体，(g) 气体。因此 \\ce{H2O(l)} 表示液态水，", "而 \\ce{H2O(g)} 表示水蒸气。", "\\end{notation}", "", "\\begin{example}[读懂化学方程式]\\label{ex:g8:balanced-equations:read}", "\\[", "  \\ce{CH4(g) + 2O2(g) -> CO2(g) + 2H2O(l)}", "\\]", "读作：一个甲烷分子与两个氧气分子反应，生成一个", "二氧化碳分子和两个水分子。左边：1 个 C，4 个 H，4 个 O。", "右边：1 个 C，4 个 H，$2 + 2 = 4$ 个 O。该方程式已配平。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\begin{scope}[every node/.style={font=\\Large, inner sep=2pt}]", "    \\node (a) at (0,0) {\\ce{CH4}};", "    \\node (p1) at (0.95,0) {$+$};", "    \\node (b) at (1.9,0) {\\ce{2O2}};", "    \\node (arr) at (3.35,0) {$\\longrightarrow$};", "    \\node (c) at (4.8,0) {\\ce{CO2}};", "    \\node (p2) at (5.75,0) {$+$};", "    \\node (d) at (6.8,0) {\\ce{2H2O}};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[thick, omDef] ([yshift=-2pt]a.south west) -- ++(0,-0.15) -| ([yshift=-2pt]b.south east);", "  \\node[below=8pt, text=black] at ($(a.south)!0.5!(b.south)$) {反应物};", "  \\draw[thick, omProp] ([yshift=-2pt]c.south west) -- ++(0,-0.15) -| ([yshift=-2pt]d.south east);", "  \\node[below=8pt, text=black] at ($(c.south)!0.5!(d.south)$) {生成物};", "  \\node[above=6pt of arr, font=\\small] {“反应生成”};", "  \\node[anchor=north west, align=left, draw=black!35, rounded corners=2pt,", "    font=\\small, inner sep=4pt] at (-0.3,-1.25)", "    {在 \\ce{2O2} 中：前面的大号 2 是\\textbf{化学计量数}（两个分子）；\\\\", "     位于横线下方的小 2 是\\textbf{下标}（每个分子含两个原子）。};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 化学方程式的组成部分。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{配平化学方程式}", "", "\\begin{method}[配平化学方程式]\\label{met:g8:balanced-equations:balance}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 写出反应物和生成物的正确化学式。切记", "        之后不可改动化学式：把 \\ce{H2O} 改成 \\ce{H2O2}，", "        就成了描述另一种物质。", "  \\item 数一数两边每种原子的个数。", "  \\item 每次只用化学计量数配平一种原子，从", "        两边各仅出现在一个化学式中的原子开始；", "        氢和氧最后再配。", "  \\item 再次数数，重复上述步骤，直至每种原子都配平。", "  \\item 化学计量数取最小的正整数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[氢和氧]\\label{ex:g8:balanced-equations:water}", "未配平：\\ce{H2 + O2 -> H2O} % ce-unbalanced-ok (the skeleton)", "左边有 2 个 O，右边有 1 个。在 \\ce{H2O} 前加 2，此时右边有 4 个 H，", "于是在 \\ce{H2} 前加 2：", "\\[", "  \\ce{2H2 + O2 -> 2H2O}.", "\\]", "检验：两边各有 4 个 H、2 个 O。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[铁在氧气中燃烧]\\label{ex:g8:balanced-equations:iron-oxide}", "铁与氧气反应生成氧化铁 \\ce{Fe2O3}。氧：左边 2 个，", "右边 3 个；最小公倍数为 6，故取 3 个 \\ce{O2} 和 2 个", "\\ce{Fe2O3}。于是右边有 4 个 Fe，左边也取 4 个 Fe：", "\\[", "  \\ce{4Fe + 3O2 -> 2Fe2O3}.", "\\]", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % 2 H2", "  \\foreach \\y in {0.45,-0.45} {", "    \\node[aH] (a) at (0,\\y) {}; \\node[aH] (b) at (0.45,\\y) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]\\draw[bond] (a.center) -- (b.center);\\end{scope}}", "  \\node at (1.05,0) {$+$};", "  \\node[aO] (a) at (1.6,0) {}; \\node[aO] (b) at (2.25,0) {};", "  \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "    \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=1.6pt]a.center) -- ([yshift=1.6pt]b.center);", "    \\draw[bond, line width=1.1pt] ([yshift=-1.6pt]a.center) -- ([yshift=-1.6pt]b.center);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\draw[->, thick, omProp] (2.9,0) -- (3.9,0);", "  \\foreach \\y in {0.5,-0.5} {", "    \\node[aO] (o) at (4.9,\\y+0.12) {};", "    \\node[aH] (p) at (4.35,\\y-0.28) {}; \\node[aH] (q) at (5.45,\\y-0.28) {};", "    \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "      \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (p.center); \\draw[bond] (o.center) -- (q.center);", "    \\end{scope}}", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (1.1,-1.35) {4 个 H，2 个 O};", "  \\node[align=center, font=\\footnotesize] at (4.9,-1.35) {4 个 H，2 个 O};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (2.7,-2.0) {\\ce{2H2 + O2 -> 2H2O}};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 氢气燃烧的配平方程式，用模型图表示：", "两个氢气分子与一个氧气分子反应，生成两个水", "分子。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}